      "line": "#0E0C09"
    }
  },
  "reproduction_rules": [
    "Credit the origins (see ORIGINS.md) wherever it is published or sold.",
    "Change the look only in rebung.js, as a new version; never hand-edit the sample SVGs.",
    "Keep half-height at least 8 px on screen and 3 mm in print so the chevrons stay legible.",
    "Use the straight 03-rebung-border image for fixed print borders; use the ribbon for flows, curves and diagonals."
  ],
